  "notes": "Capcom Kingpin C1.02 Opto Test entry on fresh isolated state. The ROM does not list optos here; it asks the operator to DISCONNECT THE OPTO POWER CONNECTOR J15 FROM THE POWER BOARD and press Start, identifying the opto supply connector. The scenario stops at that prompt. Flipper buttons are pressed through PinMAME's flipper-column button bits (public 84 left, 82 right): kpb105 declares FLIP_SWNO(5,6), and with keyboard handling off core_updateSw copies those bits into matrix switches 5/6 every frame, so a direct host write to 5 or 6 lasts at most one frame.",
